#. module: nli_engine
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:nli_engine.field_nli_profile__timeout_seconds
msgid ""
"How long to wait for one answer. Declared here and not fixed in the adapter "
"(D122): a nine-billion-parameter model on a laptop CPU takes minutes per "
"turn, a hosted one takes seconds, and a constant that suits one of them "
"turns every turn of the other into a failure."
msgstr ""

#. module: nli_engine
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:nli_engine.field_nli_profile__reasoning_effort
msgid ""
"How much the model may reason before answering (D98). Left empty the field "
"is not sent, for providers that do not have the feature. A model whose "
"reasoning mode is on by default spends the window before reaching the "
"envelope and answers nothing at all — measured, not feared."
msgstr ""

